{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "stock.sh builds the nightly stock report stock.txt from movements.log, but\nthe inventory gate verify.sh keeps rejecting the report. The reporting rules\nare in HANDOFF.md. Fix stock.sh so `bash verify.sh` passes, then run\n./submit.sh to send the counts to the inventory system."}
